    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary / overview</h2>In <strong>State Your Business</strong>, you step into the role of a security officer at the White House. Your primary responsibility is to decide which visitors should be granted entrance by meticulously checking their paperwork, conducting brief interviews, frisking individuals, and inspecting vehicles for illegal goods. You must stay vigilant for blacklisted visitors while ensuring dignitaries are satisfied to avoid any political repercussions.<br><br>By successfully performing your duties, you earn a salary, which can be spent on upgrades and skills to make your job easier, more efficient, and enhance overall security levels. As you excel in your role, you gain experience and advance in security rank, leading to more complex and challenging scenarios.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.poster.avif?t=1721289250\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.webm?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.mp4?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goal</h2><strong>State Your Business</strong> offers multiple objectives for you to pursue. Your main goal is to ensure the safety of the President and staff within the White House. Secondary objectives include achieving the rank of Secret Service, unlocking all upgrades and skills, and maximizing your earnings while maintaining a high level of security.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- <strong>Earn Salary:</strong> Perform your job correctly to earn a salary, which you can use to purchase upgrades and skills, making your work easier and more efficient.<br>- <strong>Level Up:</strong> Gain reputation points and advance in security rank by effectively performing your duties.<br>- <strong>Handle Special Visitors:</strong> Interact appropriately with foreign dignitaries to avoid damaging international relations.<br>- <strong>Global Representation:</strong> 37 countries are represented through dignitaries, including Germany, France, The Netherlands, Belgium, Luxembourg, Spain, Portugal, Poland, Russia, Colombia, Greece, Italy, Turkey, Israel, Iran, Iraq, Central Africa, Southern Africa, Japan, China, Australia, Austria, Canada, Mexico, USA, Czech Republic, North Korea, South Korea, Denmark, Sweden, Switzerland, Cyprus, Greenland, Ireland, and Ukraine.<br>- <strong>Search for Contraband:</strong> Identify and confiscate illegal contraband, such as narcotics and weapons.<br>- <strong>Manage Random Events:</strong> Deal with various random events and potential security breaches around the White House.<br>- <strong>Scan Deliveries:</strong> Inspect incoming deliveries for potential threats.<br>- <strong>Dog Companion:</strong> Unlock a dog companion to assist in searching for safety threats.<br>- <strong>Unlock Complex Scenarios:</strong> Progress to more complex and challenging scenarios as you advance in rank.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.poster.avif?t=1721289250\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.webm?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.mp4?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2>- <strong>Customize Your President:</strong> Choose your President's affiliation\u2014Republican, Democrat, or Independent\u2014and customize their appearance. You can opt for a serious or humorous look.<br>- <strong>Customize Your Dog:</strong> Select your canine companion from various breeds, including German Shepherd, Doberman, Dalmatian, Greyhound, Husky, Labrador, Pointer, Ridgeback, or Shiba.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special note</h2>Please note that 'State Your Business' may present a parodic, sarcastic, or exaggerated view of Western politics, news, and media.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary / overview</h2>In <strong>State Your Business</strong>, you step into the role of a security officer at the White House. Your primary responsibility is to decide which visitors should be granted entrance by meticulously checking their paperwork, conducting brief interviews, frisking individuals, and inspecting vehicles for illegal goods. You must stay vigilant for blacklisted visitors while ensuring dignitaries are satisfied to avoid any political repercussions.<br><br>By successfully performing your duties, you earn a salary, which can be spent on upgrades and skills to make your job easier, more efficient, and enhance overall security levels. As you excel in your role, you gain experience and advance in security rank, leading to more complex and challenging scenarios.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.poster.avif?t=1721289250\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.webm?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/2c53824f6b7cd0b5f205c53b14c33627.mp4?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goal</h2><strong>State Your Business</strong> offers multiple objectives for you to pursue. Your main goal is to ensure the safety of the President and staff within the White House. Secondary objectives include achieving the rank of Secret Service, unlocking all upgrades and skills, and maximizing your earnings while maintaining a high level of security.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- <strong>Earn Salary:</strong> Perform your job correctly to earn a salary, which you can use to purchase upgrades and skills, making your work easier and more efficient.<br>- <strong>Level Up:</strong> Gain reputation points and advance in security rank by effectively performing your duties.<br>- <strong>Handle Special Visitors:</strong> Interact appropriately with foreign dignitaries to avoid damaging international relations.<br>- <strong>Global Representation:</strong> 37 countries are represented through dignitaries, including Germany, France, The Netherlands, Belgium, Luxembourg, Spain, Portugal, Poland, Russia, Colombia, Greece, Italy, Turkey, Israel, Iran, Iraq, Central Africa, Southern Africa, Japan, China, Australia, Austria, Canada, Mexico, USA, Czech Republic, North Korea, South Korea, Denmark, Sweden, Switzerland, Cyprus, Greenland, Ireland, and Ukraine.<br>- <strong>Search for Contraband:</strong> Identify and confiscate illegal contraband, such as narcotics and weapons.<br>- <strong>Manage Random Events:</strong> Deal with various random events and potential security breaches around the White House.<br>- <strong>Scan Deliveries:</strong> Inspect incoming deliveries for potential threats.<br>- <strong>Dog Companion:</strong> Unlock a dog companion to assist in searching for safety threats.<br>- <strong>Unlock Complex Scenarios:</strong> Progress to more complex and challenging scenarios as you advance in rank.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.poster.avif?t=1721289250\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.webm?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979790/extras/68654fac4bcb6527a7ea8aeaab8fd3e8.mp4?t=1721289250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2>- <strong>Customize Your President:</strong> Choose your President's affiliation\u2014Republican, Democrat, or Independent\u2014and customize their appearance. You can opt for a serious or humorous look.<br>- <strong>Customize Your Dog:</strong> Select your canine companion from various breeds, including German Shepherd, Doberman, Dalmatian, Greyhound, Husky, Labrador, Pointer, Ridgeback, or Shiba.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special note</h2>Please note that 'State Your Business' may present a parodic, sarcastic, or exaggerated view of Western politics, news, and media.",
